#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:5
#: 14e9f02818fc496fbbc7409a710c50a4
msgid "HobbyKing Hydrotek"
msgstr "HobbyKing Hydrotek"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:10
#: 844315d7d4f44ce98bd36624c1bd2c8e
msgid ""
"The HobbyKing Hydrotek is a relatively fast electric powerboat with self-"
"righting feature (one pontoon fills with water while the other does not).  "
"The rear motor rotates using a steering servo making it a good test of "
"Rover's :ref:`vectored thrust <rover-vectored-thrust>` feature."
msgstr ""
"HobbyKing Hydrotek 是一款速度较快的电动快艇，具有自动复位功能（一个浮筒进水，另一个不进水）。后置电机通过转向舵机旋转，是测试 "
"Rover :ref:`矢量推力 <rover-vectored-thrust>` 功能的好选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:12
#: 1fd18b733fc14df9855200aae30275fe
msgid ""
"The motor only spins forward and the boat drives best at speeds over 2m/s."
msgstr "电机仅能正转，船在 2m/s 以上速度时行驶最佳。"

